(5258, 'Qwen3.6-35B-A3B', 'qwen3.6-35b-a3b', 'qwen', 'alibaba-cloud-modelstudio', 'bailian', 'https://help.aliyun.com/zh/model-studio/models', 262144, 260096, 65536, 'Image, Text, Video', 'Text', 'function-calling, model-experience, prefix-completion, structured-outputs, web-search', 'Qwen3.6系列35B-A3B原生视觉语言模型，基于混合架构设计，融合了线性注意力机制与稀疏混合专家模型，实现了更高的推理效率。模型效果相较3.5-35B-A3B显著提升了agentic coding能力、数学推理和代码推理能力、空间智能能力、物体定位与目标检测能力。', '2026-04-17 10:38:53', '', 0, '2026-10-18 09:00:08'),
(5259, 'HappyHorse-1.0-T2V', 'happyhorse-1.0-t2v', 'happyhorse', 'alibaba-cloud-modelstudio', 'bailian', 'https://help.aliyun.com/zh/model-studio/models', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Text', 'Video', 'model-experience', 'HappyHorse-1.0-T2V支持文生视频，具备高度还原的动态画面生成能力，能够精准理解文本语义，输出流畅自然、细节丰富的高质量视频。', '2026-04-22 01:07:19', '', 0, '2026-10-18 09:00:08'),
(5260, 'HappyHorse-1.1-I2V', 'happyhorse-1.1-i2v', 'happyhorse', 'alibaba-cloud-modelstudio', 'bailian', 'https://help.aliyun.com/zh/model-studio/models', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Image, Text', 'Video', 'model-experience', 'HappyHorse-1.1-I2V支持图生视频，进一步提升画面质感、动态表现与跨片段一致性。模型能够更精准地理解输入图像并延续创作意图，在人物皮肤质感、ID跨片段保持、动作流畅度、文字渲染稳定性以及音画同步上带来显著改善，输出更真实自然、细节丰富且一致性更高的高质量视频。', '2026-06-16 11:16:14', '', 0, '2026-10-18 09:00:08'),
(5261, 'HappyHorse-1.0-I2V', 'happyhorse-1.0-i2v', 'happyhorse', 'alibaba-cloud-modelstudio', 'bailian', 'https://help.aliyun.com/zh/model-studio/models', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Image, Text', 'Video', 'model-experience', 'HappyHorse-1.0-I2V支持图生视频，具备高度还原的动态画面生成能力，能够精准理解文本语义，输出流畅自然、细节丰富的高质量视频。', '2026-04-22 01:06:59', '', 0, '2026-10-18 09:00:08'),
(5262, 'HappyHorse-1.0-R2V', 'happyhorse-1.0-r2v', 'happyhorse', 'alibaba-cloud-modelstudio', 'bailian', 'https://help.aliyun.com/zh/model-studio/models', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Image, Text', 'Video', 'model-experience', 'HappyHorse-1.0-R2V支持参考生视频，更加稳定的主体与场景参考，支持最多9张图片参考，能够精准保持创作意图，实现更强表现能力。', '2026-04-26 15:53:40', '', 0, '2026-10-18 09:00:08'),
(5263, 'HappyHorse-1.0-Video-Edit', 'happyhorse-1.0-video-edit', 'happyhorse', 'alibaba-cloud-modelstudio', 'bailian', 'https://help.aliyun.com/zh/model-studio/models', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Text, Image, Video', 'Video', 'model-experience', 'HappyHorse-1.0-Video-Edit支持视频编辑，自然语言指令编辑视频，可参考最多5张图片局部或全局编辑视频元素，能够精准复刻视频动态过程，实现更强表现能力。', '2026-04-26 19:54:26', '', 0, '2026-10-18 09:00:08'),
