(5347, 'Qwen3.6-Plus', 'qwen3.6-plus', 'qwen', 'alibaba-cloud-modelstudio', 'bailian', 'https://help.aliyun.com/zh/model-studio/models', 1000000, 991808, 65536, 'Image, Text, Video', 'Text', 'function-calling, model-experience, prefix-completion, structured-outputs, web-search, cache', 'Qwen3.6原生视觉语言系列Plus模型，展现出与当前顶尖前沿模型相媲美的卓越性能，模型效果相较3.5系列显著提升。模型在Agentic coding、前端编程、Vibe coding等代码能力、多模态万物识别、OCR、物体定位等能力上显著增强。', '2026-04-01 20:11:50', '', 0, '2026-10-18 09:00:11'),
